        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="prayer-part" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:hashkivenu/hapores_sukkat_shalom/text"/>Guard our going out and our return to life and peace from now to eternity. Spread over us the tent of Thy peace. Blessed art Thou, O Lord, who spreads the tent of peace over us and over all His people Israel and over Jerusalem. <tei:milestone unit="prayer-part"/></tei:p>
